## 10. 数据层（data/）

5 个业务 JSON 与对应 collection 一一对应，均为"对象数组"结构，字段见 `vector_store._prepare_items`（vector_store.py:232）：

- `products.json`：id/name/brand/category/models/price_range/currency/features/target_audience/rating/sales_count/stock_status
- `tech_knowledge.json`：id/category/issue/causes/solutions/prevention
- `billing_policies.json`：id/category/policy/description/conditions/process/processing_days/refund_method
- `complaint_records.json`：id/category/complaint_type/severity/customer_feedback/root_cause/solution/compensation/status/created_at/resolved_at
- `service_info.json`：id/category/（service_channel|service_name）/（hours|value|description）/details/note

当前仓库数据由脚本生成，体量约 1000+ 条/类（Faker 脚本 `generate_faker_data.py`）。

